LPL verySimple description 

query 		of sort foo
      result 	of sort foo

		// indeed in this case the sort of the query and of the answer
		// are the same (foo). This sort is described in the module
		// ``verySimple'' which is given in the file ``verysimple.eln''
		// Note that these last two names should be the same.
      modules   verySimpleModule

		// We start the evaluation by reducing the term under query 
		// using the strategy ``simpleStrategy''.
      start with (simpleStrategy)query

end of LPL description
